# Harvested decision corpora: large, regenerable, and not evidence in
# themselves. trade_harvest.jsonl is 164MB (over GitHub's 100MB hard limit)
# and is reproduced exactly by:
#     python3 competition_agent/harvest_trades.py --seeds 60
# The fitted weights derived from it ARE committed (probes/trade_weights.json),
# so results stay reproducible without shipping the corpus.
competition_agent/probes/trade_harvest.jsonl
competition_agent/probes/*.partial.jsonl
# DAgger corpora: 100MB+, regenerable via distill_collect.py, and the trained
# checkpoint (trade_head.pt) is what downstream code actually needs.
competition_agent/probes/dagger/*.jsonl
# Phase 6 outcome corpus: hundreds of MB, regenerable via collect_outcomes.py
competition_agent/probes/outcomes/
